<view class="page">
  <image class="stadium-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="shade"></view>
  <view class="content"><view class="page-title" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}">球队</view>
    <view class="teams-hero" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}"><view><text class="teams-hero-title">我的球队</text><text class="teams-hero-subtitle">长期资产，独立管理</text></view><view class="teams-create-button" bindtap="onCreateTeam">创建球队</view></view>
    <view class="team-list" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}"><view class="team-card" wx:for="{{teams}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onTeamTap"><image class="team-logo" wx:if="{{item.logo}}" src="{{item.logo}}" mode="aspectFit"></image><view class="team-logo logo-fallback" wx:if="{{!item.logo}}"><image src="/images/icons/team.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><view class="team-main"><text class="team-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="team-metrics"><text>{{item.playerCount}} 名球员</text><text>{{item.coachCount}} 名教练</text><text>{{item.tournamentCount}} 项赛事</text></view><text class="claim-tag">{{item.claimText}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view>
    <view class="empty-team-panel" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}"><view class="empty-mark"><image src="/images/logo-saixiaofeng.png" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><text class="empty-heading">当前还没有球队</text><text class="empty-copy">你可以先创建自己的长期球队，<br/>后续再通过主办方邀请加入赛事。</text><button class="empty-create" bindtap="onCreateTeam">创建球队</button></view>
    <view class="invite-note" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}"><image src="/images/icons/shield.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><text>受邀参加赛事？请从主办方发送的邀请链接进入，系统会自动识别是新建球队还是接收预建队伍。</text></view>
    <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载球队资产…</view><view class="error-card" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>
    <view class="todo-section" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}"><text class="todo-title">赛事待办</text><view class="task-card" wx:if="{{hasTasks}}" wx:for="{{teamTasks}}" wx:key="id" data-tournament="{{item.tournamentId}}" data-team="{{item.teamId}}" bindtap="onTaskTap"><image src="/images/icons/list.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.subtitle}}</text></view><text class="todo-status">待处理</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="empty-card todo-empty" wx:if="{{!hasTasks}}">当前没有需要处理的赛事待办</view></view>
  </view>
</view>
